      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……那个，训练员。\n今年夏天可以继续观摩吗？\n我想观察白仁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52e50e9bc1e816b98f8d72c04ba64755f49e8ee08f5b776ebb8856608d1717d3",
